  '["AWS Direct Connect","AWS Site-to-Site VPN","AWS Client VPN","AWS PrivateLink"]'::json,
  '{0}',
  'Option A (AWS Direct Connect) is the correct service. It provides a dedicated, private network connection between your on-premises data center and AWS, bypassing the public internet. This offers consistent network performance, reduced network costs, and higher bandwidth options compared to internet-based VPNs. Option B (AWS Site-to-Site VPN) uses encrypted tunnels over the public internet, which can have variable performance and lower bandwidth limits. Option C (AWS Client VPN) is for individual user access, not data center connectivity. Option D (AWS PrivateLink) creates private endpoints for services within VPCs, not direct on-premises connectivity.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain42_9',
