  'Option B (correct) states that SCPs are a type of organization policy that you can use to manage permissions in your organization. SCPs offer central control over the maximum available permissions for all accounts in your organization or specific Organizational Units (OUs). Option A describes identity-based policies. Option C is related to services like AWS Control Tower or AWS Config. Option D describes AWS IAM Identity Center.',
