  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is the Account Factory, a feature within AWS Control Tower that automates the provisioning of new AWS accounts, ensuring they are created with the organization''s predefined security, networking, and compliance baselines. Option B is for managing approved IT services. Option C is the underlying service for multi-account management. Option D is a general infrastructure-as-code deployment tool.',
