  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is Amazon CloudWatch. It provides the ability to create custom dashboards that display metrics, logs, and alarms from various AWS services, offering a unified view for operational monitoring and insights. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation) automates tasks. Option C (AWS Well-Architected Tool) reviews architecture. Option D (AWS X-Ray) traces application requests.',
