  '["Amazon EBS Provisioned IOPS volumes","AWS Graviton processors","Amazon CloudFront caching","Amazon RDS Multi-AZ deployments"]'::json,
  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is AWS Graviton processors. These are custom-designed by AWS, based on the Arm architecture, and offer significantly better price/performance for a wide range of workloads compared to comparable x86-based instances. Option A (incorrect) Amazon EBS Provisioned IOPS volumes improve storage performance, not compute price/performance. Option C (incorrect) Amazon CloudFront caching improves content delivery speed and reduces origin load, not core compute performance. Option D (incorrect) Amazon RDS Multi-AZ deployments improve database reliability and availability, not compute price/performance.',
