  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is Amazon CloudWatch. It is a monitoring and observability service that collects monitoring and operational data in the form of logs, metrics, and events from AWS resources and applications. It provides a unified view of operational health and helps set alarms and react to changes. Option B (incorrect) AWS X-Ray is for tracing requests in distributed applications. Option C (incorrect) Amazon RDS Performance Insights focuses specifically on database performance. Option D (incorrect) AWS Compute Optimizer provides recommendations for resource right-sizing.',
