  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is the AWS Well-Architected Tool. The Well-Architected Framework includes a Reliability Pillar, which provides prescriptive guidance on how to design and operate reliable workloads in the cloud. The tool helps evaluate and improve architectures against these principles. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation) automates operational tasks. Option C (Amazon CloudWatch) is for monitoring. Option D (AWS X-Ray) is for application tracing.',
