  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is AWS Systems Manager Automation. It allows you to define and execute automated runbooks, which are step-by-step procedures for operational tasks, including incident response and recovery. Automating these procedures reduces human error and speeds up recovery, thereby improving reliability. Option B (incorrect) AWS Compute Optimizer recommends resource right-sizing. Option C (incorrect) AWS Security Hub aggregates security findings. Option D (incorrect) AWS X-Ray profiles application performance. These services are not designed for automating recovery runbooks.',
