  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon RDS Performance Insights. It provides deep visibility into database performance, allowing users to identify long-running queries, analyze wait events, and understand database load. This proactive monitoring helps detect and resolve issues before they significantly impact application reliability. Option A (incorrect) Amazon CloudWatch provides general metrics but lacks the detailed database-specific insights of Performance Insights. Option C (incorrect) AWS Systems Manager Automation is for operational task automation. Option D (incorrect) AWS IAM Access Analyzer focuses on security and access permissions.',
