  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is AWS Systems Manager Automation. It allows you to create Automation documents (runbooks) that define a series of steps to perform operational tasks, including recovery procedures. These can be triggered by Amazon CloudWatch Alarms to automatically execute recovery steps, minimizing manual intervention and improving reliability. Option A (incorrect) Amazon CloudWatch Alarms can detect issues and trigger actions, but they don''t define the recovery steps themselves. Option C (incorrect) AWS Compute Optimizer provides resource recommendations. Option D (incorrect) AWS Security Hub aggregates security findings.',
