  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is AWS X-Ray. It provides end-to-end tracing of requests across distributed services, generating a service map that visualizes the interactions between components. This allows the team to easily identify latency issues, errors, and performance bottlenecks, which are critical for improving application reliability. Option B (incorrect) Amazon CloudWatch Logs collects log data but doesn''t provide the visual tracing and service map. Option C (incorrect) Amazon GuardDuty is a threat detection service. Option D (incorrect) AWS IAM Access Analyzer focuses on access permissions.',
