VALUES (
  'q_44_m_44_4_41',
  'A financial institution needs to ensure the integrity and availability of its critical data by protecting against unauthorized access or modification. Which AWS service provides continuous threat detection to identify compromised AWS accounts and instances that could impact reliability?',
