  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon GuardDuty. It continuously monitors for malicious activity and unauthorized behavior, such as compromised instances or unusual API calls, which could directly impact the integrity and availability (reliability) of critical data and systems. Detecting these threats proactively helps maintain service integrity. Option A (incorrect) AWS Systems Manager Automation is for operational task automation. Option C (incorrect) AWS Compute Optimizer recommends resource right-sizing. Option D (incorrect) AWS X-Ray profiles application performance. These services do not provide continuous threat detection.',
