VALUES (
  'q_44_m_44_4_42',
  'A Solutions Architect is reviewing IAM policies to ensure that no unintended external access to critical resources exists, as such access could lead to security breaches and compromise system reliability. Which AWS service can help identify these potential access issues?',
  'mcq',
  '["AWS Security Hub","Amazon GuardDuty","AWS IAM Access Analyzer","Amazon CloudWatch"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (correct) is AWS IAM Access Analyzer. It helps identify resources in your organization that are shared with an external entity, which could lead to unintended access. By identifying and remediating these findings, you reduce the risk of security breaches that could compromise the reliability and integrity of your systems. Option A (incorrect) AWS Security Hub aggregates security findings. Option B (incorrect) Amazon GuardDuty is a threat detection service. Option D (incorrect) Amazon CloudWatch is a monitoring service. None of these are specifically designed for analyzing external access to resources.',
