  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is AWS IAM Access Analyzer. It can analyze access activity in AWS CloudTrail logs to generate IAM policies that grant only the permissions that have been used, helping to enforce the principle of least privilege. Option A (incorrect) Amazon CloudWatch monitors and collects metrics, logs, and events, but does not generate IAM policies. Option C (incorrect) AWS Security Hub aggregates security findings. Option D (incorrect) AWS Systems Manager Automation automates operational tasks. None of these services are designed for generating IAM policies based on usage.',
