  '{1}',
  'Option B (correct) is Amazon GuardDuty, which provides intelligent threat detection and continuous monitoring for malicious activity and unauthorized behavior across AWS accounts and workloads. It uses machine learning, anomaly detection, and integrated threat intelligence. Option A (incorrect) is AWS IAM Access Analyzer, which helps identify resources shared with an external entity, but it doesn''t provide continuous threat detection for malicious activity. Option C (incorrect) is AWS Security Hub, which aggregates security findings from various AWS services, but it is not the primary service for detecting the threats itself. Option D (incorrect) is AWS Systems Manager Automation, which can be used for remediation, but not for initial threat detection.',
