  '{0}',
  'Option A (correct) is AWS Systems Manager Automation. It allows you to create runbooks to automate actions like stopping or starting EC2 instances based on a schedule or event, which is an effective strategy for cost optimization for non-production environments. Option B (AWS Compute Optimizer) provides recommendations but doesn''t execute actions. Option C (Amazon CloudWatch) can trigger events but needs another service to perform the action. Option D (AWS Well-Architected Tool) provides guidance.',
