  '["AWS KMS","AWS IAM","AWS Secrets Manager","Amazon S3"]'::json,
  '{2}',
  'Option C (AWS Secrets Manager) is the dedicated service for securely storing, managing, and rotating sensitive information such as database credentials, API keys, and other secrets. Option A (AWS KMS) manages encryption keys. Option B (AWS IAM) manages user and service access. Option D (Amazon S3) is object storage.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain43_9',
  NOW(),
  106,
  NULL,
