  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'The process begins by creating a new Service Control Policy (SCP) (Option B). Within this new SCP, you define the specific deny statement in JSON format to restrict EC2 launches in the desired region (Option A). Once the policy is defined, attach the SCP to the target Organizational Unit (OU) to apply the restrictions to all accounts within it (Option C). Finally, it is crucial to test the SCP effect by attempting to perform the restricted action, such as launching an EC2 instance, to ensure it works as intended (Option D).',
