  'The initial step for AWS Control Tower is to set up the account factory (Option B), which defines the baseline for new accounts. Following this, you configure the mandatory and optional guardrails that enforce policies and best practices across your organization (Option C). Once the landing zone is established with guardrails, existing AWS accounts can be enrolled into it (Option A). Finally, new accounts can be provisioned through the account factory, automatically inheriting the defined guardrails (Option D).',
