VALUES (
  'q_42_m_42_5_57',
  'A company has identified stable, long-running Amazon EC2 workloads and wants to reduce compute costs. Order the steps to effectively utilize Amazon EC2 Reserved Instances (RIs).',
  'ordering',
  '["Purchase appropriate EC2 Reserved Instances","Analyze historical EC2 usage patterns and instance types","Monitor RI utilization and coverage regularly","Apply recommendations from AWS Cost Explorer for RI optimization"]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To effectively utilize EC2 Reserved Instances, first analyze historical EC2 usage patterns and identify stable instance types and regions (Option B). Based on this analysis, purchase the appropriate EC2 Reserved Instances (Option A). After purchase, it''s crucial to monitor RI utilization and coverage regularly to ensure they are being fully used (Option C). Finally, apply recommendations from AWS Cost Explorer for RI optimization to adjust your RI portfolio as needs change (Option D).',
