  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'Configuring an AWS Budget begins by creating a new budget in the AWS Budgets console (Option B). Next, define the budget scope, specifying what costs the budget will cover (e.g., specific services, accounts, or resources with certain tags) (Option A). After defining the scope, specify the budget amount and the period over which it applies (e.g., $1000 monthly) (Option C). Finally, configure alerts to notify you when actual or forecasted costs exceed your defined thresholds (Option D).',
