  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To generate a custom cost report, first navigate to the AWS Cost Explorer console (Option B). Next, select the desired time range for your report, such as ''Last 3 months'' or a custom period (Option A). Then, apply filters to narrow down the costs to specific criteria like service, region, linked account, or custom tags (Option C). Finally, group the costs by a specific dimension, such as ''Service'' or ''Usage Type'', to visualize spending patterns (Option D).',
