  'To adopt AWS Savings Plans, first analyze historical compute spend to determine an appropriate hourly commitment level (Option A). Based on this analysis, purchase a Savings Plan with the chosen hourly commitment (Option B). After purchasing, continuously monitor Savings Plan utilization and coverage to ensure maximum savings are achieved (Option C). Finally, adjust the Savings Plan commitment based on evolving compute needs and recommendations to maintain optimal cost efficiency (Option D).',
