  '{0,2}',
  'Option A (AWS Lambda) is the core serverless compute service, executing code without provisioning or managing servers. Option C (Amazon API Gateway) is commonly used to create, publish, maintain, monitor, and secure REST, HTTP, and WebSocket APIs for serverless backends. Option B (Amazon EC2) is a virtual server service, requiring server management. Option D (Amazon ECS) is a container orchestration service that can run on EC2 or AWS Fargate, but is not inherently serverless compute itself. Option E (Amazon RDS) is a managed relational database service.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain43_9',
  NOW(),
  1,
