  '{0,2}',
  'Option A (AWS Well-Architected Tool) provides a mechanism to review workloads against the AWS Well-Architected Framework. Option C (AWS Well-Architected Framework) itself is the set of best practices and guiding principles for designing and operating reliable, secure, efficient, and cost-effective systems in the cloud. Option B (AWS Systems Manager Automation) is for automating operational tasks. Option D (Amazon CloudWatch) is for monitoring and observability. Option E (AWS X-Ray) is for application tracing and debugging. Both the tool and the framework are essential for conducting architecture reviews.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain44_9',
  NOW(),
  6,
  NULL,
  NULL,
  'm_44_1',
  'medium'
);

