  '{0,3}',
  'AWS Systems Manager (Option D) provides a unified interface to view operational data from multiple AWS services and automate operational tasks across your AWS resources. Specifically, its capabilities like Run Command, Patch Manager, and Inventory are crucial for managing EC2 fleets. AWS Systems Manager Automation (Option A) is a feature within AWS Systems Manager that allows you to automate operational runbooks. Amazon CloudWatch (Option B) is for monitoring, and AWS X-Ray (Option C) is for application tracing. AWS Well-Architected Tool (Option E) is for architectural reviews.',
