  'A company is migrating legacy applications to AWS and needs to improve their security posture by adopting AWS-native controls. They are particularly concerned about identifying potential threats and ensuring that their IAM policies grant only necessary permissions. Which AWS services should they prioritize for these improvements? (Select TWO.)',
  'multiple',
