  '{0}',
  'Option A (AWS Application Migration Service (MGN)) is the primary service for automated lift-and-shift migrations of servers to AWS. Option B (AWS Database Migration Service (DMS)) is for database migrations. Option C (AWS Schema Conversion Tool (SCT)) assists with schema conversion for databases. Option D (AWS DataSync) is for online data transfer to AWS storage services.',
