  '["Provision an Amazon ElastiCache for Memcached cluster.","Configure the application''s security group to allow inbound connections to the Memcached cluster.","Update the application code to connect to the ElastiCache endpoint and implement caching logic.","Monitor the cache performance and application latency."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'The first step is to provision the Amazon ElastiCache for Memcached cluster (Option A). Next, network access needs to be established by configuring the application''s security group to permit inbound connections to the ElastiCache cluster (Option B). After the cluster is accessible, the application code must be updated to utilize the ElastiCache endpoint and incorporate caching logic (Option C). Finally, monitoring the cache''s performance and the application''s overall latency is essential to confirm the effectiveness of the caching solution (Option D).',
