  '["Provision an Amazon DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) cluster.","Configure security groups to allow application access to the DAX cluster.","Modify the application code to use the DAX client for DynamoDB operations.","Monitor DAX cache hit ratio and DynamoDB read capacity unit (RCU) consumption."]'::json,
  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'The first step is to provision the Amazon DynamoDB Accelerator (DAX) cluster (Option A). Next, network access must be configured by setting up security groups to allow the application to connect to the DAX cluster (Option B). After the DAX cluster is accessible, the application code needs to be modified to use the DAX client for all DynamoDB operations, which automatically leverages the cache (Option C). Finally, monitoring the DAX cache hit ratio and DynamoDB RCU consumption is crucial to confirm the expected performance improvements and cost savings (Option D).',
