  '{1,3,0,2}',
  'To advance IaC maturity, first define infrastructure resources using IaC templates (Option B) like AWS CloudFormation, moving away from manual configurations. Next, establish version control (Option D) for these IaC templates to track changes and facilitate collaboration. After that, implement automated testing and validation (Option A) for the IaC templates to ensure correctness and prevent errors before deployment. Finally, integrate IaC deployments into a CI/CD pipeline (Option C) to achieve fully automated and consistent infrastructure provisioning.',
