  'ordering',
  '["Configure CloudWatch Logs to collect application and system logs from EC2 instances.","Enable AWS CloudTrail to log all API activity across the AWS account.","Create CloudWatch Logs Insights queries and dashboards for log analysis.","Set up CloudWatch Alarms based on specific log patterns for proactive alerting."]'::json,
  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To implement centralized logging, first enable AWS CloudTrail (Option B) to log all API activity across the AWS account, providing an audit trail. Next, configure CloudWatch Logs (Option A) to collect application and system logs from EC2 instances or other services. Then, create CloudWatch Logs Insights queries and dashboards (Option C) to analyze and visualize the collected log data for troubleshooting and operational insights. Finally, set up CloudWatch Alarms (Option D) based on specific log patterns to receive proactive alerts on critical events or errors.',
