  'Analyzing Amazon RDS database performance with Performance Insights starts with enabling the feature. Option B (Enable Performance Insights for the RDS instance) is the initial configuration step. Option C (Navigate to the Performance Insights dashboard in the RDS console) is where the visual data is presented. Option A (Identify high-load SQL queries or database sessions) is the analytical step, using the dashboard to pinpoint performance bottlenecks. Option D (Adjust database parameters or optimize queries based on findings) is the remediation step, applying changes to improve performance.',
