  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'Publishing custom metrics to Amazon CloudWatch requires defining the metric, sending the data, and then visualizing/analyzing it. Option B (Define the custom metric namespace and dimension) establishes the unique identifier and categorization for the metric. Option A (Publish custom metric data using the AWS SDK or CLI) is the action of sending the actual data points to CloudWatch. Option C (Create CloudWatch dashboards to visualize the custom metric) allows for graphical representation of the data. Option D (Analyze the metric data to identify performance trends) is the final step to derive insights from the collected data.',
