  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'Analyzing AWS X-Ray traces for performance bottlenecks starts with an overview and then drills down into specifics. Option B (Navigate to the X-Ray console and view service maps) provides a high-level visual representation of the application''s components and their interactions. Option A (Identify services or segments with high latency) involves using the service map to spot areas of concern. Option C (Drill down into specific traces to examine details) allows for in-depth investigation of individual requests and their execution paths. Option D (Implement code optimizations or architectural changes based on findings) is the action phase, applying solutions to resolve the identified bottlenecks.',
