  '{1,2,3,0}',
  'To improve application performance, first, instrument the application with the AWS X-Ray SDK and CloudWatch metrics (Option B) to collect detailed performance data. Next, deploy the instrumented application and generate representative load (Option C) to produce meaningful telemetry. Then, review CloudWatch metrics and logs (Option D) for overall resource utilization, error rates, and general health. Concurrently, analyze X-Ray service maps and trace data (Option A) to pinpoint specific latency issues and bottlenecks within distributed components. Option A is a detailed analysis step after data collection. Option C must follow instrumentation. Option D provides a high-level view before deep-diving with X-Ray.',
