  '["Enable X-Ray tracing for the Lambda function.","Analyze the X-Ray service map to identify slow components.","Examine individual traces to understand latency distribution within a request.","Generate traffic to the Lambda function to produce X-Ray traces."]'::json,
  '{0,3,1,2}',
