  '{1,0,2,3}',
  'To optimize global access, first create an Amazon CloudFront distribution (Option B) with the application''s origin to cache content closer to users. Next, configure AWS Global Accelerator endpoints (Option A) to point to this CloudFront distribution, providing static IP addresses and intelligent routing. Then, update DNS records (Option C) to point to the Global Accelerator static IP addresses, directing user traffic through the optimized network path. Finally, thoroughly test end-to-end latency and performance (Option D) from various geographic locations to validate the improvements.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain44_9',
