  '["Identify the top SQL queries, hosts, or users consuming the most database resources.","Enable Amazon RDS Performance Insights for the target RDS for MySQL instance.","Analyze the Performance Insights dashboard to visualize database load and wait events.","Implement query optimizations or schema changes based on identified bottlenecks."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To utilize Amazon RDS Performance Insights, first enable the feature for the target RDS for MySQL instance (Option B). Once data is collected, analyze the Performance Insights dashboard (Option C) to visualize database load, wait events, and active sessions. Based on this visualization, identify the top SQL queries, hosts, or users (Option A) that are consuming the most database resources. Finally, implement query optimizations or schema changes (Option D) to address the identified bottlenecks and improve database performance.',
