  '{0,1,2,3}',
  'To configure a CloudFront distribution for a static website on S3, first configure the S3 bucket for static website hosting (Option A) and ensure public access is correctly set up. Next, create a CloudFront web distribution (Option B), specifying the S3 bucket''s static website endpoint as the origin. Then, update DNS records (Option C) for your domain name to point to the CloudFront distribution''s domain name, directing user traffic through CloudFront. Finally, test content delivery and caching (Option D) from various edge locations to verify performance improvements and correct functionality.',
