  'A solutions architect needs to improve the performance of a read-heavy Amazon RDS for MySQL database. Order the steps to implement an Amazon RDS Read Replica for scaling read operations.',
  'ordering',
  '["Modify application connection strings to direct read traffic to the Read Replica endpoint.","Create an Amazon RDS Read Replica from the primary RDS for MySQL instance.","Monitor the Read Replica''s performance and replication lag.","Identify read-heavy queries in the application workload."]'::json,
  '{3,1,0,2}',
  'To implement an Amazon RDS Read Replica, first identify read-heavy queries (Option D) in the application workload to confirm the need for read scaling. Next, create an Amazon RDS Read Replica (Option B) from the primary RDS for MySQL instance. Then, modify application connection strings (Option A) to direct read traffic to the Read Replica endpoint, offloading the primary database. Finally, monitor the Read Replica''s performance and replication lag (Option C) using Amazon CloudWatch to ensure it is effectively handling read operations and staying synchronized with the primary.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain44_9',
  NOW(),
