  'ordering',
  '["Review GuardDuty findings and investigate threats.","Enable GuardDuty from the AWS console.","Configure trusted IP lists and threat lists (optional).","Integrate GuardDuty with Security Hub for centralized findings."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'Activating and using Amazon GuardDuty begins with enabling the service. Option B (Enable GuardDuty from the AWS console) is the initial step to turn on the threat detection service. Option C (Configure trusted IP lists and threat lists (optional)) allows for customization of detection by specifying known safe or malicious IPs. Option A (Review GuardDuty findings and investigate threats) is the core operational activity after findings are generated. Option D (Integrate GuardDuty with Security Hub for centralized findings) is a best practice to consolidate security alerts from multiple services.',
