  '["Review findings and identify unintended external access.","Enable Access Analyzer for an AWS Region.","Generate least-privilege policies based on access activity.","Remediate external access by modifying resource policies."]'::json,
  '{1,0,3,2}',
  'Leveraging AWS IAM Access Analyzer involves enabling the service, reviewing findings, remediating issues, and generating policies. Option B (Enable Access Analyzer for an AWS Region) is the first step to activate the service. Option A (Review findings and identify unintended external access) is the analytical step, where the service''s output is examined. Option D (Remediate external access by modifying resource policies) is the action taken to address identified security risks. Option C (Generate least-privilege policies based on access activity) is a subsequent step to refine permissions based on actual usage, often after initial remediation.',
  NOW(),
