  '{1,3,2,0}',
  'To effectively utilize AWS Savings Plans, first analyze historical compute usage patterns (Option B) in AWS Cost Explorer to understand consistent spending. Next, evaluate the Savings Plan recommendations (Option D) provided by AWS Cost Explorer, which suggest optimal commitment levels. Then, purchase a Savings Plan (Option C) based on the recommended commitment and desired term (1-year or 3-year). Finally, continuously monitor Savings Plans utilization and coverage (Option A) using AWS Cost Explorer to ensure maximum savings and adjust future commitments as needed.',
