VALUES (
  'q_44_m_44_5_58',
  'A solutions architect needs to optimize storage costs for infrequently accessed data in Amazon S3. Order the steps to transition objects to a more cost-effective storage class.',
  'ordering',
  '["Create an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval.","Analyze access patterns of objects in the S3 bucket.","Configure an S3 Lifecycle rule to transition objects from S3 Standard to S3 Standard-IA.","Monitor storage costs and retrieval patterns after the lifecycle rule is applied."]'::json,
  '{1,2,0,3}',
  'To optimize S3 storage costs, first analyze access patterns (Option B) of objects in the S3 bucket to determine how frequently they are accessed. Based on this, configure an S3 Lifecycle rule (Option C) to transition objects from S3 Standard to S3 Standard-IA for data accessed less frequently. For archival data, create another S3 Lifecycle rule (Option A) to transition objects to S3 Glacier Flexible Retrieval after a longer period. Finally, monitor storage costs and retrieval patterns (Option D) after the lifecycle rules are applied to ensure optimal cost savings without impacting performance.',
