VALUES (
  'q_44_m_44_5_59',
  'A solutions architect needs to improve the cost-effectiveness of Amazon EC2 instances by identifying and eliminating underutilized resources. Order the steps to perform a cost optimization review for EC2.',
  'ordering',
  '["Identify underutilized EC2 instances based on CPU, memory, and network metrics.","Implement right-sizing or termination of identified underutilized instances.","Collect Amazon CloudWatch metrics for EC2 instances over a period.","Analyze the cost impact of the changes using AWS Cost Explorer."]'::json,
  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'To perform a cost optimization review for EC2, first collect Amazon CloudWatch metrics (Option C) for EC2 instances over a sufficient period (e.g., 2-4 weeks) to capture typical usage patterns. Next, identify underutilized EC2 instances (Option A) based on these metrics, looking for consistently low CPU, memory, or network utilization. Then, implement right-sizing or termination (Option B) of the identified underutilized instances to reduce costs. Finally, analyze the cost impact (Option D) of the changes using AWS Cost Explorer to quantify the savings achieved.',
