  '["Install the AWS Agentless Discovery Connector or Agent on servers","Review discovered data in AWS Migration Hub","Configure data collection in AWS Application Discovery Service","Create an AWS Migration Hub home Region"]'::json,
  '{3,2,0,1}',
  'To perform discovery, you first need to create an AWS Migration Hub home Region (Option D), as Application Discovery Service integrates with Migration Hub. Next, configure data collection within AWS Application Discovery Service (Option C). Then, install the AWS Agentless Discovery Connector or Agent on the on-premises servers (Option A) to collect data. Finally, review the collected and discovered data in AWS Migration Hub (Option B).',
