  'Order the steps to track the progress of a server migration project using AWS Migration Hub.',
  'ordering',
  '["Monitor migration status and progress","Configure data sources for migration tools","Set up a Migration Hub home Region","Group applications and define migration waves"]'::json,
  '{2,1,3,0}',
  'To track migration progress, you must first set up a Migration Hub home Region (Option C). Then, configure data sources for the various migration tools being used (Option B), such as AWS Application Migration Service or AWS Database Migration Service. After data sources are set, group applications and define migration waves (Option D) to organize the migration. Finally, monitor the migration status and progress (Option A) through the Migration Hub dashboard.',
