  'Order the common sequence of activities when developing a Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) analysis for cloud migration.',
  'ordering',
  '["Calculate on-premises infrastructure and operational costs","Compare total costs and present findings","Estimate AWS cloud service costs","Identify scope and gather data for analysis"]'::json,
  '{3,0,2,1}',
  'Developing a TCO analysis begins by identifying the scope and gathering relevant data for the analysis (Option D). Next, calculate the current on-premises infrastructure and operational costs (Option A). Then, estimate the corresponding AWS cloud service costs (Option C) for the proposed migration. Finally, compare the total costs (on-premises vs. AWS) and present the findings (Option B) to stakeholders.',
  NOW(),
  'quiz_domain45_9',
