  'The process begins by installing the appropriate collector (Option A) on the on-premises environment to gather data. Next, the data collection parameters need to be configured (Option C). Once data is collected, it can be viewed and analyzed within AWS Migration Hub (Option B). Finally, reports can be generated (Option D) to aid in migration planning and cost analysis.',
