  'The initial step is to configure the AWS Migration Hub home region and connect it with discovery tools like AWS Application Discovery Service (Option D). Once connected, data collection from on-premises environments is initiated (Option B). After discovery, servers are grouped into logical applications (Option A) to manage them effectively. Finally, the migration progress for these applications can be monitored (Option C) within Migration Hub.',
