VALUES (
  'q_45_m_45_1_99',
  'A company is planning a phased migration of its applications to AWS. Order the following conceptual steps for prioritizing workloads in a migration wave.',
  'ordering',
  '["Evaluate the business impact and criticality of each application.","Identify interdependencies between applications to minimize disruption.","Assess the technical complexity and effort required for migrating each application.","Sequence applications into migration waves based on risk and benefit."]'::json,
  '{2,0,1,3}',
  'Prioritizing workloads typically begins with assessing the technical complexity and effort (Option C) to understand the migration challenge. Concurrently, the business impact and criticality (Option A) are evaluated to determine the value of migration. Identifying interdependencies (Option B) is crucial to ensure a smooth transition and avoid breaking connections. Finally, applications are sequenced into migration waves (Option D) considering all these factors to manage risk and maximize benefit.',
