  '{0,2,3,1}',
  'The planning phase typically starts with defining the overall migration strategy and target architecture (Option A) to set the direction. Next, assembling and training the migration team (Option C) ensures the right skills are in place. Establishing security, compliance, and governance frameworks (Option D) is critical before any actual migration. Finally, a detailed migration runbook (Option B) is developed to guide the execution.',
