  '{1,0,3,2}',
  'The evaluation process should begin by thoroughly documenting the application''s current state (Option B) to establish a baseline. Following this, identifying current pain points and limitations (Option A) helps pinpoint areas for improvement. Next, exploring cloud-native alternatives (Option D) allows for considering modernization opportunities. Finally, based on the analysis, the most suitable migration or modernization strategy (Option C) is selected.',
