  'The initial step is to create a replication instance in DMS (Option B), which performs the actual data migration. Next, create a source endpoint for the on-premises database (Option A), providing connection details. Then, create a target endpoint for the AWS database (Option C), specifying the destination. Finally, create and start a migration task (Option D) to define what data to migrate and begin the process.',
