  '{0,2,3,1}',
  'To configure IRSA, first create an IAM policy (Option A) that defines the permissions your service account needs. Next, create an IAM role (Option C) with a trust policy that allows the EKS OIDC provider to assume it. Then, associate the IAM policy with this newly created IAM role (Option D). Finally, annotate the Kubernetes service account (Option B) in your EKS cluster with the ARN of this IAM role, linking the two.',
